          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the rapid passage of a light followed by a trail: probable observation of an atmospheric reentry of a meteoroid (meteorite fall).",
          "translation_text_sha256": "a1dd7e4701082e35c8a8a1e748e261488d68f45ed2be9c929f2fb43b95074f9b"
